 "notes": {
  "en": [
   "PROPOSAL: TRENCH DRAINS DISCHARGE DIRECTLY INTO THE EXISTING DRAINAGE MANHOLES (MH-NW, MH-SW, MH-SE). THE %%c200 DISCHARGE INTO THE %%c400 BT PIPE PER E5/CG501 IS CANCELLED.",
