   "%%c200 INVERTS AND TRENCH DRAIN SLOPES PER COORDINATED PROFILE (GOVT REMARK c.i) - TO BE ISSUED.",
   "RED = PROPOSED.  DIMENSIONS IN METERS, SCALED FROM CG104/CG105 - APPROXIMATE."
  ],
